Source: acdat
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Vonng/ac

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-acdat
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-acdat
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: compiled multi-pattern matching for PostgreSQL
 acdat compiles large exact-literal dictionaries into immutable Aho-Corasick
 Double-Array machines. It scans text or bytea values once to test for matches,
 enumerate overlapping hits, or perform deterministic replacement.
